  <p>
    The SS19 Hardshell Anorak features color blocked three layer fabric that is cut, sewn and taped by its respective color. Have a look inside the jacket. We backed the main body fabric with the same color tricot as the face to create a unique visual experience on the inside of the jacket. The Hardshell Anorak has been finished with sturdy custom debossed metal press studs to secure the sleeve tabs and center front placket. 
  </p>
  <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/adsum-ss19-lookbook-55-opti.jpg?17417502178983782429" style="max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto;">
  <div class="blog-img-caption">High visibility reflective throat tab and color blocked elbow on the Lightweight Anorak</div>
  <p>
    The soft-shell variant of our full zip anorak utilizes a Japanese milled, stretch, three layer and waterproof-breathable main body fabric. The face side of the bonded main body fabric is a ripstop stretch nylon quality. Having a ripstop face quality helps reduce continuous ripping if a small tear occurs from daily use. Instead of metal press studs, the lightweight anorak has 10MM matte finish Sun-Tenac snaps for pocket and center front placket closure to reduce weight and help with jacket packability. 
  </p>
